  <item>
    <title>不是我不学，而是我没遇到这份‘学习基地‘焚诀！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af14a2b5b7c4709bfe33a5b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af14a2b5b7c4709bfe33a5b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 04:26:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>明明下定决心狠狠学，结果走进图书馆流浪半小时，雄心壮志还没开始就胎死腹中，学习热情就此归零？</span></p><p><span>本期我们决定认真探讨学习圣地这一世纪难题：到底什么样的空间，才能让我们心甘情愿地坐下来学习？</span></p><p><span>上挂房梁、下钻地道！从学习圣地的五星测评，到大教室与小隔间的派系之争；从座位带来的归属感，到主播们各显神通的抢座秘籍，我们发现，所谓的 </span><em><span>sacred place</span></em><span>，还真大有学问。</span></p><h4><span>Highlight</span></h4><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> Evita：好学、好座、好景、好喝、好拉——学习圣地的从夯到拉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a> Jenny：大教室vs小隔间，老鼠人专座vs阳光落地窗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> Winnie：网红座位请退散！比起漂亮，我更需要一块属于自己的地盘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2024">33:44</a> Evita：大道至简，就近原则。保护三分钟热度的最好方式之“盖盖子”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a> Jenny：避峰潜入，上挂房梁下钻地道，学习座位争夺战的隐身攻略</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> Winnie：一个座位坐到天荒地老，可控的空间才是终极安全感的来源</span></p><h3><strong><span>Music</span></strong></h3><p><span>Day Off - Roa</span></p><h3><strong><span>协会Staff</span></strong></h3><p><span>Winnie Jenny Evita</span></p><p><span>小地瓜@国际扯淡协会</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fef23adb25c8b386bba199/lk7KS4Q02DH1an305hw9hnX8sh_I.m4a" length="42740323" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKQNesLqadFXW8t0QgBB_IiZ-my.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.02 对桌游的社交属性，我回复TD</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad38df30e4e410a05be5f80</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad38df30e4e410a05be5f80</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:05:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>书接上回，尴尬的破冰游戏总是让每个参与者道不尽一把辛酸泪，但不要担心——桌游，作为新时代最具社交属性的团体活动，腾空出世，强势加盟各大迎新活动，荣誉当选主播们心中最适合破冰的“神器”之一。</span></p><p><span>面对琳琅满目的桌游，实操起来竟然也有许多门道，桌游爱好者 vs. 桌游闲鱼又有话要说了！究竟哪款桌游是我们心中的破冰不二之选？桌游门外汉又为何对此心生畏惧？且听主播们为你扯淡 :)</span></p><h4><span>Highlight</span></h4><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> Evita：Yes-桌游but-社交，竞技是人类最纯粹的乐趣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a> Jenny：狼人杀，我所恐惧的智商大披露</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> Winnie：（不见得）真心话（但一定）大冒险，真的给我们带来了新话题吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> Evita：纯粹的战斗爽，史诗级的阿瓦隆局居然来源于一桌陌生人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1563">26:03</a> Jenny：讨厌竞技，喜欢单机，我还可以玩桌游吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2271">37:51</a> Winnie：“下一把清零”，桌游带给我的魄力与底气</span></p><h3><span>Music</span></h3><p><span>Day Off - Roa</span></p><h3><span>协会Staff</span></h3><p><span>Winnie Jenny Evita</span></p><p><span>小地瓜@国际扯淡协会</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fef23adb25c8b386bba199/lgpTQtXh0stahUtYEkyHbqWrNlOF.m4a" length="42076832" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkffVt-Ol1U6ME8Gx63V_h7XR_pM.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.01大学季重磅来袭！迎新周破冰二三事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac1b723195d838e2aed13ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac1b723195d838e2aed13ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 02:24:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位新朋友老朋友们，欢迎来到摸鱼扯淡大学季！新学期新气象，大家的摸鱼好搭子们自然也迎来了一个全新的开始。步入大学，首当其冲的自然是作为新生的各色迎新活动，那自然也少不了让人啼笑皆非的ice breaking环节了。为什么啼笑皆非？当然是因为多数时候破冰环节就只是一群陌生人在尬到抠脚的小游戏中面面相觑，至于冰层什么时候会被打破，那就只能祈祷哪里蹦出一位勇士来活跃气氛了。</span></p><h4><strong><span>Highlight</span></strong></h4><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> Evita：丰富多彩or诡计多端的迎新周小活动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> Jenny：i者自i，燃者自燃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="747">12:27</a> Evita: nonono! i人也有自己最爱的ice break小游戏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a> Jenny：论如何让一群刚认识半小时的人爆发出超燃团魂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a> Winnie: 拒绝动物表演，却忘了拒绝人类表演</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> Winnie: 面对大团体的自我介绍，同时折磨了我和听众</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2223">37:03</a> Jenny: 我们都曾绞尽脑汁地想fun fact，但今天你的强来了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2761">46:01</a> Evita: 不认真听自我介绍的朋友们，你的惩罚还在加码！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3266">54:26</a> Winnie: 破冰无需上热灶，请陌生人拿开你的肢体接触游戏！</span></p><h3><strong><span>Music</span></strong></h3><p><span>Day Off - Roa</span></p><h3><strong><span>协会Staff</span></strong></h3><p><span>Winnie Jenny Evita</span></p><p><span>小地瓜@国际扯淡协会</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fef23adb25c8b386bba199/lupa-YpKJIeSS5HXMuxVnGgZfhcB.m4a" length="62762455" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpt6OLfDTP3kK0Z_LkVDcGom24BY.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.43 快给大忙人让道</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696c49d2109824f9e111e83c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696c49d2109824f9e111e83c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 02:51:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>高三，一个足以让任何人闻风丧胆的词语，身处其中仿佛坠入无间地狱————这是许多人会对高三产生的评价。作为标准的东亚学生，高三堪称人生中必打的一仗、成年以前最大的劫难，但远离了传统应试教育体系后，高三还一样吗？我们这些“跑路”的国际留学生的高三，或者说“申请季”又是怎样度过的呢？且听我们细细道来。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Highlight</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 国际生们的高三进行时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 忙完你的忙你的！国际生雨露均沾的艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 与中介的爱恨情仇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a> 离开世界给高三生打的伞，才发现外面根本没有下雨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">32:02</a> 让高三生做回普通人：少点关注作品，多点关注生活</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Day Off - Roa</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>协会Staff</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Winnie Evita Jenny</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书@国际扯淡协会</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以在apple podcast，喜马拉雅找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>RSS feed：</span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l"><span>https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fef23adb25c8b386bba199/ltZiNdAbVEc6dtZhkwetlKsgtZUg.m4a" length="35192073" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqS0LCgahxp36QJYNnAhcoIEO4Po.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.42 宅人留子冬日生存指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693de9c937f52a644ec88c9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">693de9c937f52a644ec88c9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Dec 2025 22:39:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又是一年冬，城市逐渐被冰封，我们盼望着冬休的同时也发起愁来。多伦多这片广袤的土地实在太不热情，一年竟能有近一半时间都埋在半人高的雪里，这可给享受假期的人制造了不少麻烦。试想，圣诞假期的某一天，你从温暖的被窝中悠悠转醒，拉开窗帘，惊讶地发现车道已然被昨天彻夜未停的大雪占领。想必没有人会在此时鼓起勇气出门，可一直宅在家人也容易长毛，欲知如何解决，且听我们细细道来。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Highlight</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>火锅，燃起来了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 八卦局？最好聊的聚餐选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 多伦多火锅罪全书</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>攒不上的局，轰不成的pa</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1271">21:11</a> 拳打狼人杀 脚踢斗地主 再约场半年后的剧本杀</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>令人嫉恨的短暂润人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> 总有那么几个人在坎昆，总有那么几个人在美国</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Day Off - Roa</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>协会Staff</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Winnie Evita Jenny</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书@国际扯淡协会</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以在apple podcast，喜马拉雅找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>RSS feed：</span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l"><span>https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fef23adb25c8b386bba199/lhR0JWkv-6dY1us1d1tZbVBQA8Qf.m4a" length="41268347" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoH7rlbw6nbdPG7LycT-tUrvfDly.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.41 春游秋游事件簿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690377affd16c105526e700f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690377affd16c105526e700f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Oct 2025 14:39:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果说成长注定要失去什么东西，那首当其冲的应该就是春游秋游。这一项中小学限定活动随着学历的提高，无声无息地淡出了我们的视野。可必须要承认，过去的每一次春游秋游，都有让人彻夜难眠、辗转反侧的魔力。就算它们已然远去，也还是留下了一些值得怀念或吐槽的故事（事故）。当初为止恼火也好激动也罢的情绪早已退潮，只剩下浅浅一捧水划过指尖，供长大的我们咀嚼。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Highlight</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 春游综合症：睡不着觉vs完全不睡的小学生们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 春游保留节目之午餐环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 春游最佳地点票选：欢乐谷？科技馆？农家乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 抓马春游故事</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> Winnie：本班同学正处于“打水漂都能闯祸”的年纪</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> Evita：参观欢乐谷毛毛虫或将成为春游mvp</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> Jenny：校领导讲话前摇过长，压轴鬼屋惜败摇摆校车</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a> 只有一起春游过的，才是亲同学！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Day Off - Roa</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>协会Staff</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Winnie Evita Jenny</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书@国际扯淡协会</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以在apple podcast，喜马拉雅找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>RSS feed：</span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l"><span>https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fef23adb25c8b386bba199/lk8nKbiPyNlLhL40-bFAUim-8VP_.m4a" length="61047447" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnX3eFCqAF7l_PGodXjTXembKrKp.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.40 屎上最差劲老师评选大会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f3ac4b456ffec65e670c22</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f3ac4b456ffec65e670c22</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Oct 2025 15:24:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>古人云：“一日为师，终生为父。”作为尚未步入社会的学生，我们在“认爹”这条路上也是行走了多年，可谓是颇有心得。幸好绝大多数老师（老爹）还算得上略通人性，没有过多折磨自己的便宜孩子。但万事万物总有特例，就是有那么一群老师，他们精神错乱、风格癫狂、行事乖张，在逼迫我们成为哪吒的路上越走越远。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Highlight</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> intro：那些年我们遇到的神人老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 咦，好像有蚊子在叫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">08:36</a> 莫欺老年穷：最爱升旗发言的永远是…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> 莫欺中年穷：厚积薄发男选手 输在基因理科女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 洛哈特校长挥刀砍向艺术学校的艺术预算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a> 你永远叫不醒一个装病的人但老师版</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2797">46:37</a> 本期重磅嘉宾：将心向明月 就不向物理</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>惊喜彩蛋环节</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3325">55:25</a> 纵享happy hour的纯良微醺比格</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Day Off - Roa</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>协会Staff</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Winnie Evita Jenny</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书@国际扯淡协会</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以在apple podcast，喜马拉雅找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>RSS feed：</span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l"><span>https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>合作邮箱：letstalkerightnowwej@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
