  <item>
    <title>VOL.38 请世界无偿归还我的如厕自由</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c38b55a56ca3e0c400f50e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c38b55a56ca3e0c400f50e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Sep 2025 02:59:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>生活中令人无语的事情很多，但令人无语到想笑的事情并不占多数。当这样的事发生在如厕这样一个私密且神圣的场合时，造成的伤害会诡异地剧增。有时候，真的很难想象5分钟前在此处喷射的是何方神圣。究竟是赛博坦星来客？还是氪星超人？总之，每回拉开这扇隐蔽的门，都是一次对身心的双重考验（或许也考验了鼻子）。若是情况紧急，则触发大无语事件的概率直线上升，进行一次顺畅的排泄难度也大大提高。但人类到底是适应力强悍，逼急了多无语都得硬着头皮上。毕竟，负重前行的难度也不低。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Highlight</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 艰苦卓绝的上厕所之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a> 比上不了厕所更可怕的是“负重”跑操</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a> 那些年的厕所俗世奇人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>花样百出的学校厕所设计</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> “一路畅通”的坑位设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 为了上厕所，我曾百米冲刺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a> 锁不上的锁还能叫锁吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>这些厕所还想不想干了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 厕所标识：安能辨我是雌雄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1796">29:56</a> 是什么让马桶成为深蹲器械</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> xx机场惊悚喷射厕所</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 请男童对号如厕</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Day Off - Roa</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>协会Staff</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Winnie Evita Jenny</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书@国际扯淡协会</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以在apple podcast，喜马拉雅找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>RSS feed：</span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l"><span>https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>合作邮箱：letstalkerightnowwej@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fef23adb25c8b386bba199/ljKFDhwU16eP1QBH9Hl4gfY1z7Qs.m4a" length="69090068" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr0uo5kA-8narxlFbINgG9nCC99J.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
