  <item>
    <title>VOL.33 下课铃响后</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684edf722a38b4d979c6ed38</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">684edf722a38b4d979c6ed38</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Jun 2025 14:58:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>校园生活总是藏有许多不可说的秘密，就比如莘莘学子们无一不在期盼着的同个声音，那就是————下课铃。每当这美妙的声音打响，朗朗读书声里昏昏欲睡的大脑会立即被唤醒（或是彻底陷入沉睡），压抑的天性在此刻也迎来了解放。此刻，操场大舞台，有梦你就来。在下课铃响后，世界尽在我们手中。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>highlight</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>不得不说的国内课间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> &nbsp;拖堂拖拖拖到厌倦：奋起反击不如就地写作业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> 梦中的操场：游戏圣地or监狱放风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> 串班：10分钟课间不是social的极限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 跑操，你不要过来啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>加拿大的课间赛跑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> 在加拿大我们下课...上课了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 被走班制溺爱的松弛感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 绝不拖堂的传统美德</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 上厕所马拉松</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Day Off - Roa</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>协会Staff</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Winnie Evita Jenny</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书@国际扯淡协会</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以在apple podcast，喜马拉雅找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>RSS feed：</span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l"><span>https://feed.xyzfm.space/geat4tnbd47l</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>合作邮箱：letstalkerightnowwej@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
